{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's make ramen on the Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on ramen orders, make the ramen quickly and correctly, then serve it up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach for the ultimate high score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u300aRules\u300b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make and serve as much ramen as you can before time runs out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pour the soup, boil the noodles, then add the right toppings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay attention to the firmness of the noodles and fill each order correctly!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u300aHow to Play\u300b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Check the order - Memorize the ramen type and noodle firmness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Add the soup - Be careful not to mess up the flavor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Boil the noodles - Once the firmness is just right, drain the water!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Add the toppings - Follow the recipe for each ramen type!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Serve it up - Get the order correct for the most points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Score Attack]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with players from all over the world for the top spot on the leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Battle]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with others and test your ramen-making skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To receive news and update notifications</strong><br>Please click on <strong>Developer: SAT-BOX</strong> at the top of the store page and <strong>Follow</strong> us!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3733740?t=1773042839","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3733740?t=17730